// Library.SQLite.ailang — native SQLite file reader/writer (pager + btree + WAL)
//
// No SQL parser. mmap the database file, walk btrees, decode records.
// Dirty pages live in a Hash overlay (page-number string -> buffer) and
// commit as WAL frames. One open database.
//
// Copyright (c) 2026 Sean Collins, 2 Paws Machine and Engineering.
// Released under the MIT License, as required for submissions to this challenge.

